    <h1>portcreate</h1>

    <p class="lead">Create a new port directory and starter recipe for the Vylen ports tree.</p>
    <div class="command-line"># portcreate [options] &lt;name&gt;</div>
</section>

<section class="doc">
    <h2 id="usage">Usage</h2>

    <pre><code>portcreate -h
portcreate hello</code></pre>

    <p>
        Review the generated <code>build.eme</code>, replace every placeholder,
        add dependencies, and test the recipe with <code>pkgbuild</code>. Never
        submit an unreviewed skeleton as a usable port.
    </p>
